      {
        "id": "tb-masked-bce-loss",
        "moduleId": "masked-loss",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "带掩码的二元交叉熵损失",
        "markdown": "教材使用**带掩码的二元交叉熵损失**。`SigmoidBCELoss` 对每个预测计算 `binary_cross_entropy_with_logits`，用 `reduction=\"none\"` 保留逐元素损失，再用 `mean(dim=1)` 在 `max_len` 维上取平均；`mask` 把填充位置的权重置 0：\n\n```python\nclass SigmoidBCELoss(nn.Module):\n    # 带掩码的二元交叉熵损失\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n\n    def forward(self, inputs, target, mask=None):\n        out = nn.functional.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits(\n            inputs, target, weight=mask, reduction=\"none\")\n        return out.mean(dim=1)\n\nloss = SigmoidBCELoss()\n```\n\n训练循环中再把每个样本的损失按 `mask.sum(axis=1)` 归一化、乘回 `mask.shape[1]`，从而只在非掩码预测上取平均。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-945d2620c63addae20887a5d",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000206"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "自然语言处理：预训练",
                "预训练word2vec",
                "训练",
                "二元交叉熵损失"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11543,
              "lineEnd": 11609,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3e0fd00dd4f6913fb295e4d58c0242d9b5a622a3369c6e3a2b81fe2cbdbbe487"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-mask-normalization",
        "moduleId": "masked-loss",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "掩码与归一化的作用",
        "markdown": "掩码只回答「这个位置算不算数」。设 `mask.shape[1] = L`、有效位置数为 `m = mask.sum(axis=1)`，把按 `L` 个位置平均后的损失乘以 $L / m$，就等价于只在 `m` 个有效位置上求平均；若不做这一步，填充位会把损失稀释。\n\n教材给出的手工核对也说明了这一点：`pred = [1.1, -2.2, 3.3, -4.4]`。第一行标签 `[1, 0, 0, 0]` 全部有效，四项损失取平均；第二行掩码 `[1, 1, 0, 0]`，只保留前两项损失再除以 2。其中 $\\operatorname{sigmd}(x) = \\log(1 + e^{-x})$ 对应标签为 1 时的交叉熵，标签为 0 时则取 $\\operatorname{sigmd}(-x)$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-loss-prelude",
            "tb-masked-bce-loss"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-init-embeddings",
        "moduleId": "init-train",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "初始化两张嵌入矩阵",
        "markdown": "接着初始化模型参数：定义**两个嵌入层**，分别把词表中的所有词当作中心词和上下文词使用；词向量维度 `embed_size` 设为 100。\n\n```python\nembed_size = 100\nnet = nn.Sequential(nn.Embedding(num_embeddings=len(vocab),\n                                 embedding_dim=embed_size),\n                    nn.Embedding(num_embeddings=len(vocab),\n                                 embedding_dim=embed_size))\n```",
