      {
        "id": "model-training-checklist",
        "moduleId": "init-train",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "训练代码自检顺序",
        "markdown": "按固定顺序检查训练代码，能更快定位实现错误：\n\n1. 每个批量先 `optimizer.zero_grad()`，清掉上一批的梯度；\n2. `skip_gram` 用 `net[0]` 处理中心词、`net[1]` 处理上下文与噪声词；\n3. 预测先 `reshape` 到标签形状，再送入带掩码的损失；\n4. 损失按有效位置数归一化后 `sum().backward()`；\n5. `optimizer.step()` 更新参数，并记录规范化后的平均损失。\n\n若损失不下降，先核对第 2 步两个嵌入层是否用反，再检查第 3 步预测与标签是否对齐。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-train-function"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-apply-embeddings",
        "moduleId": "similarity-eval",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "应用词嵌入：查找相似词",
        "markdown": "训练完 word2vec 模型后，可以用词向量的**余弦相似度**从词表中找出与输入词语义最相似的词。`get_similar_tokens` 取嵌入矩阵 `W` 与查询词向量 `x`，计算每个词的余弦相似度后取前 $k+1$ 个；第一个是查询词本身，输出时跳过：\n\n```python\ndef get_similar_tokens(query_token, k, embed):\n    W = embed.weight.data\n    x = W[vocab[query_token]]\n    # 计算余弦相似性。增加1e-9以获得数值稳定性\n    cos = torch.mv(W, x) / torch.sqrt(torch.sum(W * W, dim=1) *\n                                      torch.sum(x * x) + 1e-9)\n    topk = torch.topk(cos, k=k+1)[1].cpu().numpy().astype('int32')\n    for i in topk[1:]:  # 删除输入词\n        print(f'cosine sim={float(cos[i]):.3f}: {vocab.to_tokens(i)}')\n\nget_similar_tokens('chip', 3, net[0])\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-945d2620c63addae20887a5d",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000209"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "自然语言处理：预训练",
                "预训练word2vec",
                "应用词嵌入"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11736,
              "lineEnd": 11784,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "8bec0c66f96691e47ed91e877f61e5576b90faa30ea0cdc44872660a275ffef7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-cosine-similarity",
        "moduleId": "similarity-eval",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "余弦相似度衡量方向而非长度",
        "markdown": "余弦相似度比较的是两个向量的方向，而不是它们的长度：\n\n$$\\cos(\\mathbf{x}, \\mathbf{w}_i) = \\frac{\\mathbf{w}_i^{\\top}\\mathbf{x}}{\\sqrt{(\\mathbf{w}_i^{\\top}\\mathbf{w}_i)(\\mathbf{x}^{\\top}\\mathbf{x})}}$$\n\n代码里 `torch.mv(W, x)` 一次算出所有行的点积，`torch.sqrt(torch.sum(W * W, dim=1) * torch.sum(x * x) + 1e-9)` 给出分母；加 `1e-9` 只是为了避免零向量导致除零。相似度越接近 1，两个词在训练语料中的使用方式越接近。示例中查询 `chip` 得到的近邻是否合理，取决于语料规模、窗口大小和训练轮数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-apply-embeddings"
          ]
        }
      },
